          "relation": "uses",
          "snippet": {
            "line": 827,
            "text": "theorem outgoing_boundary_tendsto_zero (d : OutgoingTail.TailData) (C y₀ : ℝ)\n    {t z : ℝ} (ht : t < 1) :\n    Tendsto (boundary (heatAmplitude C (1 + d.h) t)\n      (radialSlice (flattening d.h (fun y => OutgoingTail.tailShape d (y - y₀))) t z)) atTop (𝓝 0)"
